<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify Your Email - Blood Donation Platform</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
        color: #2b2d42;
      }
      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 40px 0;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 550px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 36px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        border-top: 5px solid #d90429;
      }
      .header-logo {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .header-logo h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #d90429;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .title {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #1d3557;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #4a5568;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .otp-box {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }
      .otp-code {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        background: #fff5f5;
        color: #d90429;
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 10px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 2px dashed #ff8585;
      }
      .notice {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #718096;
        background-color: #f7fafc;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-top: 24px;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 32px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #a0aec0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="header-logo">
          <h1> Blood Donation & Emergency Platform</h1>
        </div>
        <h2 class="title">Verify Your Email Address</h2>
        <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
        <p>Thank you for signing up for the Blood Donation & Emergency Assistance Platform. To complete your account registration, please enter the One-Time Password (OTP) below:</p>
        
        <div class="otp-box">
          <div class="otp-code"><%= otp %></div>
        </div>

        <p>This verification code is valid for <strong><%= expirationMinutes %> minutes</strong>. For your security, never share this code with anyone.</p>
        
        <div class="notice">
          If you did not request this registration, please ignore this email or contact our support team.
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Blood Donation & Emergency Assistance Platform. All rights reserved.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
